  "_schema": {
    "note": "Body-level INTENT tables. Every generated body picks a HOME intent and a different AWAY intent from its family's pool; the morph becomes a NAMED transformation (e.g. 'ah -> ee'), not a random shape change. Each intent's freq list is aligned to its template's feature slots (in order). Template gain/bw/kind still come from target_templates.json; intent pins the frequency.",
    "vocal_source": "Klatt 1980, adult-male reference voice (cf. Klatt, JASA 67(3))",
    "freq_jitter": "the generator applies ~4% log-jitter per slot so bodies with the same (home,away) intent pair vary; gain/bw still sampled from the template ranges (with AWAY hotter).",
    "clean_room": "No EMU/Morpheus/Z-plane references in product-facing copy. Intent names are producer-musical."
  },
